          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "- Saves battery and CPU: stops processing the music waveform, voice-recording waveform, and song progress bar when the screen is off.\n- Stops background timers when music is not playing.\n- Only runs the voice-recording waveform that is currently visible.\n- Fixed a loop that kept running when the device has no passcode or the lock notch is disabled.\n- Fixed the answer / decline call buttons.\n- Maps notch no longer overwrites the clipboard.\n- Fixed leaks when sending/receiving AirDrop and Personal Hotspot."
